### AIMNK Push Notifications API Testing
### Base URL: http://localhost:3013/api/v1/push

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3013/api/v1
@authToken = {{$dotenv AUTH_TOKEN}}

### ============================================
### 🔓 ENDPOINTS PÚBLICOS
### ============================================

### 1. Obtener clave pública VAPID
GET {{baseUrl}}/push/vapid-key
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### 🔒 ENDPOINTS AUTENTICADOS  
### ============================================

### 2. Registrar suscripción push
POST {{baseUrl}}/push/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "subscription": {
    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/example-endpoint-123456789",
    "keys": {
      "p256dh": "BG4F4mbUqhxzMJHhKJn9E4zR1t8zH9HhbE8wB7UhuYVNvLC9m6LGb8BKjqUMGwX4E8Th9c5TLJwC9Q7v2HB8F9Q",
      "auth": "example-auth-key-12345678901234567890"
    }
  }
}

### 3. Obtener suscripciones del usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/push/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Enviar notificación de prueba
POST {{baseUrl}}/push/test
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Enviar notificación personalizada
POST {{baseUrl}}/push/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "🧪 Test Personalizado",
  "body": "Esta es una notificación de prueba personalizada desde la API",
  "type": "test",
  "actionUrl": "/comunidad"
}

### 6. Obtener estadísticas
GET {{baseUrl}}/push/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Limpiar suscripciones inactivas
POST {{baseUrl}}/push/cleanup
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Desregistrar suscripción
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/push/unsubscribe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/example-endpoint-123456789"
}

### ============================================
### 🧪 TESTS COMPLETOS DE INTEGRACIÓN
### ============================================

### Test 1: Flujo completo de registro
# 1. Obtener VAPID key
GET {{baseUrl}}/push/vapid-key

### 
# 2. Registrar suscripción
POST {{baseUrl}}/push/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "subscription": {
    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/test-integration-endpoint",
    "keys": {
      "p256dh": "BIntegrationTestP256dhKeyExample123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345",
      "auth": "IntegrationTestAuthKey1234567890"
    }
  }
}

###
# 3. Verificar suscripción
GET {{baseUrl}}/push/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
# 4. Enviar prueba
POST {{baseUrl}}/push/test
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
# 5. Ver estadísticas
GET {{baseUrl}}/push/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
# 6. Desregistrar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/push/unsubscribe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/test-integration-endpoint"
}

### ============================================
### 🔄 TESTS DE NOTIFICACIONES AUTOMÁTICAS
### ============================================

### Crear un post para generar notificaciones automáticas
POST {{baseUrl}}/SER/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "content": "🔔 Post de prueba para testing de push notifications automáticas #test",
  "hashtags": ["test", "push", "notifications"]
}

### Dar like a un post (esto debería generar push notification automática)
POST {{baseUrl}}/SER/posts/POST_ID_HERE/like
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Ver notificaciones generadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/SER/notifications?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================
### 🐛 TESTS DE CASOS EDGE
### ============================================

### Error: Sin autenticación
POST {{baseUrl}}/push/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscription": {
    "endpoint": "test",
    "keys": {"p256dh": "test", "auth": "test"}
  }
}

### Error: Datos inválidos
POST {{baseUrl}}/push/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "subscription": {
    "endpoint": "",
    "keys": {}
  }
}

### Error: Endpoint inexistente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/push/unsubscribe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "endpoint": "https://endpoint-que-no-existe.com"
}

### ============================================
### 📊 MONITOREO Y DEBUGGING
### ============================================

### Ver estado general del sistema
GET {{baseUrl}}/push/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Limpiar datos de prueba
POST {{baseUrl}}/push/cleanup
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ============================================
### 📝 NOTAS DE TESTING
### ============================================

# Para hacer testing real:
# 1. Reemplazar {{authToken}} con un JWT válido
# 2. Usar endpoints reales de FCM/Mozilla Push Service
# 3. Configurar Service Worker en el frontend
# 4. Registrar dispositivo real desde el navegador

# Endpoints de testing de FCM:
# - Chrome: https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/*
# - Firefox: https://updates.push.services.mozilla.com/*

# Para generar claves VAPID reales:
# npx web-push generate-vapid-keys

### ============================================
### 🔧 DEBUGGING COMÚN
### ============================================

# Error: "VAPID key not configured"
# Verificar variables de entorno en .env

# Error: "No active subscriptions"  
# Usuario no tiene dispositivos registrados

# Error: "User is online"
# Sistema detectó usuario activo, no envía push

# Success: "Push notification sent"
# Notificación enviada correctamente

### ============================================